DvD IOPaint Interactive Eraser

The erase-model URLs, checksums, preprocessing behavior, and vendored runtime
sources in this plugin are adapted from IOPaint 1.6.0, commit
61a759fb3f332bacdce8b2813f4837495c9b86e0:
https://github.com/Sanster/IOPaint

IOPaint is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The adapted implementation
has been modified for an isolated package namespace, Python 3.13 compatibility,
ComfyUI model paths, device handling, error handling, and the interactive node
workflow.

The optional Mask Generator integrates the separately distributed `rembg`
package (MIT, Daniel Gatis) for RemoveBG and ISNet Anime inference. `rembg`,
its ONNX runtime, and the downloaded model weights retain their respective
upstream licenses. This repository does not bundle those weights; they are
fetched from the URLs used by the installed `rembg` release on first use.

The SAM Interactive Segmentation node includes a vendored copy of the
Segment Anything (SAM1) inference implementation from Meta Platforms, Inc.:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/segment-anything

That source is distributed under the Apache License 2.0. The vendored files
retain their upstream copyright headers; this plugin only isolates the Python
package namespace and adapts checkpoint/model-path handling for ComfyUI. SAM1
checkpoints are downloaded at runtime from the URLs declared in `nodes.py` and
are not included in this repository.
